{:edb/committed true :edb/basis-t 2224 :edb/replayed false :edb/tx-hash "df1e0df3d7f09074cd11a4a3ed8295d41462d0b1a4d31f7b93f77758b3b8a75f" :edb/db-before-t 2223 :edb/db-after-t 2224 :edb/tx-data [[13194139535536 50 #inst "2026-10-09T02:01:12.360Z" 13194139535536 true] [17592186105848 1020 #edb/ref 17592186354232 13194139535536 true] [17592186105848 1020 #edb/ref 17592186354239 13194139535536 true] [17592186105848 1020 #edb/ref 17592186354253 13194139535536 true] [17592186105849 1020 #edb/ref 17592186354246 13194139535536 true] [17592186106203 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139535536 true] [17592186106203 1100 "Find the total area of the region bounded by the graph of the curve $y = \\mid x \\mid e^{-x^{2}}$ and the $x$-axis." 13194139535536 false] [17592186106203 1100 "Find the total area of the region bounded by the graph of the curve $y=|x|{e}^{-{x}^{2}}$ and the $x$-axis." 13194139535536 true] [17592186106203 1145 "We find the area of the region bounded by the graph of the curve and the $x$-axis by calculating the integral\n\n$$\nA={\\int }_{-\\infty }^{\\infty }|x|{e}^{-{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nWe break up the integral as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{-\\infty }^{\\infty }|x|{e}^{-{x}^{2}}\\text{d}x={\\int }_{-\\infty }^{0}|x|{e}^{-{x}^{2}}\\text{d}x+{\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }|x|{e}^{-{x}^{2}}\\text{d}x\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe start by calculating the first of these integrals:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{-\\infty }^{0}|x|{e}^{-{x}^{2}}\\text{d}x=-{\\int }_{-\\infty }^{0}x{e}^{-{x}^{2}}\\text{d}x\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe calculate the antiderivative using a substitution. Let  $u=-{x}^{2}$,  then $\\text{d}u=-2x\\text{d}x.$ Hence,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int x{e}^{-{x}^{2}}\\text{d}x & =-\\frac{1}{2}\\int {e}^{u}\\text{d}u \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{2}{e}^{u}+C \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{2}{e}^{-{x}^{2}}+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe now evaluate the integral, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{-\\infty }^{0}|x|{e}^{-{x}^{2}}\\text{d}x & =-{\\int }_{-\\infty }^{0}x{e}^{-{x}^{2}}\\text{d}x \\\\  & =-{lim}_{a\\to -\\infty }{\\int }_{a}^{0}x{e}^{-{x}^{2}}\\text{d}x \\\\  & =-{lim}_{a\\to -\\infty }({-\\frac{1}{2}{e}^{-{x}^{2}}|}_{a}^{0}) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}{lim}_{a\\to -\\infty }({e}^{0}-{e}^{-{a}^{2}}) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}(1-0) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, notice that the integrand $|x|{e}^{-{x}^{2}}$ is an **even** function. This means that we can immediately deduce that\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }|x|{e}^{-{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x=\\frac{1}{2}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, since both improper integrals exist, we conclude that \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{-\\infty }^{\\infty }|x|{e}^{-{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x & ={\\int }_{-\\infty }^{0}|x|{e}^{-{x}^{2}}\\text{d}x+{\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }|x|{e}^{-{x}^{2}}\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}+\\frac{1}{2} \\\\  & =1.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535536 true] [17592186354232 1017 #edb/ref 17592186354233 13194139535536 true] [17592186354232 1089 "q-118776" 13194139535536 true] [17592186354232 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139535536 true] [17592186354232 1100 "Evaluate the integral ${\\int }_{-\\infty }^{\\infty }\\frac{x}{{(3+{x}^{2})}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x.$" 13194139535536 true] [17592186354232 1113 #uuid "aa4a3d4f-86d7-526d-8b7d-9356bb095979" 13194139535536 true] [17592186354232 1145 "We break up the integral as follows:\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{-\\infty }^{\\infty }\\frac{x}{{(3+{x}^{2})}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x={\\int }_{-\\infty }^{0}\\frac{x}{{(3+{x}^{2})}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x+{\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }\\frac{x}{{(3+{x}^{2})}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x\n$$\n\nFirst, we calculate the antiderivative using a substitution. Let  $u=3+{x}^{2}$,  then $\\text{d}u=2x\\text{d}x.$ Hence,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{x}{{(3+{x}^{2})}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\frac{1}{2}\\int \\frac{1}{{u}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot (-\\frac{1}{u})+C \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{2(3+{x}^{2})}+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe now evaluate the first of the improper integrals, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{-\\infty }^{0}\\frac{x}{{(3+{x}^{2})}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x & ={lim}_{a\\to -\\infty }{\\int }_{a}^{0}\\frac{x}{{(3+{x}^{2})}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={lim}_{a\\to -\\infty }{(-\\frac{1}{2(3+{x}^{2})})|}_{a}^{0} \\\\  & =-{lim}_{a\\to -\\infty }(\\frac{1}{2(3+0)}-\\frac{1}{2(3+{a}^{2})}) \\\\  & =-(\\frac{1}{6}-0) \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{6}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, notice that the integrand is an **odd** function. This means that we can immediately deduce that\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }\\frac{x}{{(3+{x}^{2})}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x=\\frac{1}{6}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, since both improper integrals exist, we conclude that \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{-\\infty }^{\\infty }\\frac{x}{{(3+{x}^{2})}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x & ={\\int }_{-\\infty }^{0}\\frac{x}{{(3+{x}^{2})}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x+{\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }\\frac{x}{{(3+{x}^{2})}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{6}+\\frac{1}{6} \\\\  & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535536 true] [17592186354233 1000 #edb/ref 17592186354234 13194139535536 true] [17592186354233 1000 #edb/ref 17592186354235 13194139535536 true] [17592186354233 1000 #edb/ref 17592186354236 13194139535536 true] [17592186354233 1000 #edb/ref 17592186354237 13194139535536 true] [17592186354233 1000 #edb/ref 17592186354238 13194139535536 true] [17592186354233 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535536 true] [17592186354233 1041 "selection" 13194139535536 true] [17592186354233 1104 #edb/ref 17592186354238 13194139535536 true] [17592186354233 1110 #uuid "b190eda4-0caa-5dc2-a98a-1322d9b66a73" 13194139535536 true] [17592186354234 1034 "\\frac{1}{2}" 13194139535536 true] [17592186354234 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535536 true] [17592186354234 1111 #uuid "4e831a23-ec58-57c0-b08a-10f1936c0841" 13194139535536 true] [17592186354235 1034 "2" 13194139535536 true] [17592186354235 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535536 true] [17592186354235 1111 #uuid "eed4fa3d-ca16-5a44-a65e-da0e02f4853c" 13194139535536 true] [17592186354236 1034 "\\frac{1}{6}" 13194139535536 true] [17592186354236 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535536 true] [17592186354236 1111 #uuid "a37aeded-9bcc-5dea-b427-9c06442ba73a" 13194139535536 true] [17592186354237 1034 "\\frac{1}{3}" 13194139535536 true] [17592186354237 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535536 true] [17592186354237 1111 #uuid "4983a346-cbaf-59f1-833e-14e3d492549a" 13194139535536 true] [17592186354238 1034 "0" 13194139535536 true] [17592186354238 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535536 true] [17592186354238 1111 #uuid "5eebd6b6-65b8-5ecb-b8b5-3fed8d561976" 13194139535536 true] [17592186354239 1017 #edb/ref 17592186354240 13194139535536 true] [17592186354239 1089 "q-118777" 13194139535536 true] [17592186354239 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139535536 true] [17592186354239 1100 "Evaluate ${\\int }_{-\\infty }^{\\infty }\\frac{3}{9+2{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x.$" 13194139535536 true] [17592186354239 1113 #uuid "e1104938-8add-5c20-aaed-a503fbe2493d" 13194139535536 true] [17592186354239 1145 "We break up the integral as follows:\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{-\\infty }^{\\infty }\\frac{3}{9+2{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x={\\int }_{-\\infty }^{0}\\frac{3}{9+2{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x+{\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }\\frac{3}{9+2{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nEvaluating the first of these integrals, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{-\\infty }^{0}\\frac{3}{9+2{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x & ={lim}_{a\\to -\\infty }{\\int }_{a}^{0}\\frac{3}{9+2{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{3}{2}{lim}_{a\\to -\\infty }{\\int }_{a}^{0}\\frac{1}{{x}^{2}+{(\\frac{3}{\\sqrt{2}})}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}{lim}_{a\\to -\\infty }({\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(\\frac{\\sqrt{2}x}{3})|}_{a}^{0}) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}{lim}_{a\\to -\\infty }[\\operatorname{arctan}⁡0-\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(\\frac{\\sqrt{2}a}{3})] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\cdot [0-(-\\frac{\\pi }{2})] \\\\  & =\\frac{\\pi }{2\\sqrt{2}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, notice that the integrand is an **even** function. This means that we can immediately deduce that\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }\\frac{3}{9+2{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x=\\frac{\\pi }{2\\sqrt{2}}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, since both improper integrals exist, we conclude that \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{-\\infty }^{\\infty }\\frac{3}{9+2{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x & ={\\int }_{-\\infty }^{0}\\frac{3}{9+2{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x+{\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }\\frac{3}{9+2{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{\\pi }{2\\sqrt{2}}+\\frac{\\pi }{2\\sqrt{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\pi }{\\sqrt{2}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535536 true] [17592186354240 1000 #edb/ref 17592186354241 13194139535536 true] [17592186354240 1000 #edb/ref 17592186354242 13194139535536 true] [17592186354240 1000 #edb/ref 17592186354243 13194139535536 true] [17592186354240 1000 #edb/ref 17592186354244 13194139535536 true] [17592186354240 1000 #edb/ref 17592186354245 13194139535536 true] [17592186354240 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535536 true] [17592186354240 1041 "selection" 13194139535536 true] [17592186354240 1104 #edb/ref 17592186354245 13194139535536 true] [17592186354240 1110 #uuid "93e72a3e-09bd-544e-aa7f-fa5fd9aa8792" 13194139535536 true] [17592186354241 1034 "\\frac{\\sqrt{2}\\pi }{3}" 13194139535536 true] [17592186354241 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535536 true] [17592186354241 1111 #uuid "fd0b8ec2-e548-5200-a362-c9139d70275a" 13194139535536 true] [17592186354242 1034 "\\frac{\\pi }{2}" 13194139535536 true] [17592186354242 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535536 true] [17592186354242 1111 #uuid "b5a46bbe-4777-5066-b5a3-5103698bef72" 13194139535536 true] [17592186354243 1034 "\\pi " 13194139535536 true] [17592186354243 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535536 true] [17592186354243 1111 #uuid "f28539e6-2dbd-58bb-9599-64198317af32" 13194139535536 true] [17592186354244 1034 "0" 13194139535536 true] [17592186354244 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535536 true] [17592186354244 1111 #uuid "0b88e548-8a1e-5925-8aac-99ade3b148d3" 13194139535536 true] [17592186354245 1034 "\\frac{\\pi }{\\sqrt{2}}" 13194139535536 true] [17592186354245 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535536 true] [17592186354245 1111 #uuid "cd82ee17-fa8c-549c-a03a-f9a0799f9870" 13194139535536 true] [17592186354246 1017 #edb/ref 17592186354247 13194139535536 true] [17592186354246 1089 "q-20797" 13194139535536 true] [17592186354246 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139535536 true] [17592186354246 1100 "Find the total area of the region bounded by the graph of the curve $y=3{x}^{2}{e}^{-|x{|}^{3}}$ and the $x$-axis." 13194139535536 true] [17592186354246 1113 #uuid "2dfa35ce-beed-58f8-8439-6e601518f0e3" 13194139535536 true] [17592186354246 1145 "We find the area of the region bounded by the graph of the curve and the $x$-axis by calculating the integral\n\n$$\nA={\\int }_{-\\infty }^{\\infty }3{x}^{2}{e}^{-|x{|}^{3}}.\n$$\n\nWe break up the integral as follows:\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{-\\infty }^{\\infty }3{x}^{2}{e}^{-|x{|}^{3}}\\,\\text{d}x={\\int }_{-\\infty }^{0}3{x}^{2}{e}^{-|x{|}^{3}}\\,\\text{d}x+{\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }3{x}^{2}{e}^{-|x{|}^{3}}\\,\\text{d}x\n$$\n\nWe start by calculating the first of these integrals:\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{-\\infty }^{0}3{x}^{2}{e}^{-|x{|}^{3}}\\,\\text{d}x={\\int }_{-\\infty }^{0}3{x}^{2}{e}^{{x}^{3}}\\,\\text{d}x\n$$\n\nWe calculate the antiderivative using a substitution. Let $u={x}^{3}$,  then $\\text{d}u=3{x}^{2}\\,\\text{d}x.$ Hence, the antiderivative is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int 3{x}^{2}{e}^{{x}^{3}}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int {e}^{u}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & ={e}^{u}+C \\\\  & ={e}^{{x}^{3}}+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{-\\infty }^{0}3{x}^{2}{e}^{-|x{|}^{3}}\\,\\text{d}x & ={\\int }_{-\\infty }^{0}3{x}^{2}{e}^{{x}^{3}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={lim}_{a\\to -\\infty }{\\int }_{a}^{0}3{x}^{2}{e}^{{x}^{3}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={lim}_{a\\to -\\infty }{({e}^{{x}^{3}})|}_{a}^{0} \\\\  & ={lim}_{a\\to -\\infty }({e}^{0}-{e}^{{a}^{3}}) \\\\  & =1-0 \\\\  & =1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, notice that the integrand $3{x}^{2}{e}^{-|x{|}^{3}}$ is an **even** function. This means that we can immediately deduce that \n\n$$\n{\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }3{x}^{2}{e}^{-|x{|}^{3}}\\,\\text{d}x=1.\n$$\n\nTherefore, since both improper integrals exist, we conclude that \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{-\\infty }^{\\infty }3{x}^{2}{e}^{-|x{|}^{3}}\\,\\text{d}x & ={\\int }_{-\\infty }^{0}3{x}^{2}{e}^{-|x{|}^{3}}\\,\\text{d}x+{\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }3{x}^{2}{e}^{-|x{|}^{3}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =1+1 \\\\  & =2.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535536 true] [17592186354247 1000 #edb/ref 17592186354248 13194139535536 true] [17592186354247 1000 #edb/ref 17592186354249 13194139535536 true] [17592186354247 1000 #edb/ref 17592186354250 13194139535536 true] [17592186354247 1000 #edb/ref 17592186354251 13194139535536 true] [17592186354247 1000 #edb/ref 17592186354252 13194139535536 true] [17592186354247 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535536 true] [17592186354247 1041 "selection" 13194139535536 true] [17592186354247 1104 #edb/ref 17592186354250 13194139535536 true] [17592186354247 1110 #uuid "5d0ef435-1c50-5611-bca4-5634a0380660" 13194139535536 true] [17592186354248 1034 "3" 13194139535536 true] [17592186354248 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535536 true] [17592186354248 1111 #uuid "ffe2c351-4438-5626-84b7-523a1e0a0461" 13194139535536 true] [17592186354249 1034 "\\frac{1}{2}" 13194139535536 true] [17592186354249 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535536 true] [17592186354249 1111 #uuid "bce81980-d4c6-51f4-a08b-bace845047cc" 13194139535536 true] [17592186354250 1034 "2" 13194139535536 true] [17592186354250 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535536 true] [17592186354250 1111 #uuid "84b84f50-e25f-59d1-89dd-1f9a117bdbb8" 13194139535536 true] [17592186354251 1034 "1" 13194139535536 true] [17592186354251 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535536 true] [17592186354251 1111 #uuid "3e8c381f-586b-5a32-a993-8f860bd663d1" 13194139535536 true] [17592186354252 1034 "4" 13194139535536 true] [17592186354252 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535536 true] [17592186354252 1111 #uuid "800d37d1-b4ef-5db7-9566-876a4ab33a73" 13194139535536 true] [17592186354253 1017 #edb/ref 17592186354254 13194139535536 true] [17592186354253 1089 "q-20804" 13194139535536 true] [17592186354253 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139535536 true] [17592186354253 1100 "Evaluate ${\\int }_{-\\infty }^{\\infty }\\frac{2x}{{x}^{4}+9}\\,\\text{d}x.$" 13194139535536 true] [17592186354253 1113 #uuid "68984b43-c28b-51c9-a2e8-e7cd0fb9d27d" 13194139535536 true] [17592186354253 1145 "We break up the integral as follows:\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{-\\infty }^{\\infty }\\frac{2x}{{x}^{4}+9}\\,\\text{d}x={\\int }_{-\\infty }^{0}\\frac{2x}{{x}^{4}+9}\\,\\text{d}x+{\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }\\frac{2x}{{x}^{4}+9}\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nFirst, we calculate the antiderivative using a substitution. Let  $u={x}^{2}$,  then $\\text{d}u=2x\\text{d}x.$ Hence,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{2x}{{x}^{4}+9}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int \\frac{1}{9+{u}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{3}\\operatorname{arctan}⁡\\frac{u}{3}+C \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{3}\\operatorname{arctan}⁡\\frac{{x}^{2}}{3}+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe now evaluate the first of the improper integrals, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{-\\infty }^{0}\\frac{2x}{{x}^{4}+9}\\,\\text{d}x & ={lim}_{a\\to -\\infty }{\\int }_{a}^{0}\\frac{2x}{{x}^{4}+9}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={lim}_{a\\to -\\infty }{(\\frac{1}{3}\\operatorname{arctan}⁡\\frac{{x}^{2}}{3})|}_{a}^{0} \\\\  & =-{lim}_{a\\to -\\infty }(\\frac{1}{3}\\operatorname{arctan}⁡\\frac{{0}^{2}}{3}-\\frac{1}{3}\\operatorname{arctan}⁡\\frac{{a}^{2}}{3}) \\\\  & =-{lim}_{a\\to -\\infty }(0-\\frac{1}{3}\\operatorname{arctan}⁡\\frac{{a}^{2}}{3}) \\\\  & =0-\\frac{\\pi }{6} \\\\  & =-\\frac{\\pi }{6}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, notice that the integrand is an **odd** function. This means that we can immediately deduce that \n\n$$\n{\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }\\frac{2x}{{x}^{4}+9}\\,\\text{d}x=\\frac{\\pi }{6}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, since both improper integrals exist, we conclude that \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{-\\infty }^{\\infty }\\frac{2x}{{x}^{4}+9}\\,\\text{d}x & ={\\int }_{-\\infty }^{0}\\frac{2x}{{x}^{4}+9}\\,\\text{d}x+{\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }\\frac{2x}{{x}^{4}+9}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =-\\frac{\\pi }{6}+\\frac{\\pi }{6} \\\\  & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535536 true] [17592186354254 1000 #edb/ref 17592186354255 13194139535536 true] [17592186354254 1000 #edb/ref 17592186354256 13194139535536 true] [17592186354254 1000 #edb/ref 17592186354257 13194139535536 true] [17592186354254 1000 #edb/ref 17592186354258 13194139535536 true] [17592186354254 1000 #edb/ref 17592186354259 13194139535536 true] [17592186354254 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535536 true] [17592186354254 1041 "selection" 13194139535536 true] [17592186354254 1104 #edb/ref 17592186354259 13194139535536 true] [17592186354254 1110 #uuid "d624deec-d629-5e5a-8626-3caa4566f007" 13194139535536 true] [17592186354255 1034 "3" 13194139535536 true] [17592186354255 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535536 true] [17592186354255 1111 #uuid "5c4fa1cb-a166-5ac0-8db4-342c00bdd9fb" 13194139535536 true] [17592186354256 1034 "\\frac{\\pi }{2}" 13194139535536 true] [17592186354256 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535536 true] [17592186354256 1111 #uuid "43e22a05-9c84-50a4-a49b-e3b90ffd284e" 13194139535536 true] [17592186354257 1034 "The integral is divergent" 13194139535536 true] [17592186354257 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139535536 true] [17592186354257 1111 #uuid "15bc5a5d-5f32-5827-95aa-cea376046798" 13194139535536 true] [17592186354258 1034 "4" 13194139535536 true] [17592186354258 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535536 true] [17592186354258 1111 #uuid "6ebb3d87-0b26-538f-9887-ee0670dee379" 13194139535536 true] [17592186354259 1034 "0" 13194139535536 true] [17592186354259 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535536 true] [17592186354259 1111 #uuid "1045e7e0-b7da-55ad-be68-d1290286416b" 13194139535536 true]] :edb/temp